    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但參判使一行在館中飯米且外向ニ差遣候音物銀其外一行中ニ旅"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "但し、參判使一行が館中に在留中の飯米、且つ外向きに差し遣わし候音物銀、その外、一行中に旅…"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note: the ration rice for the Sanpanshi (vice-minister) envoy party while resident in the Japan House, together with the gift-silver dispatched for external presentation, and further, for the members of the party, trav— (the sentence continues in the next column)"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "但書參判使入費注記前段"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
